          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect The ironclad annihilator beetle stomps the ground. All creatures within a 30-foot emanation must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:44) saving throw or fall Prone and become Stunned 1 (stunned for 1 round on a critical failure).",
