          "description": "The arboreal regent causes a tree within 180 feet to uproot itself and fight as a minion using the statistics for an Awakened Tree. The arboreal regent can control up to two awakened trees at a time, and it can issue commands to both trees as a single action, which has the concentrate and auditory traits.",
