          "name": "Fling",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The tar zombie mammoth has a creature Grabbed or Restrained by its trunk\nEffect The tar zombie mammoth whips its prey violently into the air. It attempts an check (athletics, defense:fortitude) check against the grabbed or restrained creature's Fortitude DC. If the creature is restrained, the mammoth gains a +4 circumstance bonus to this check. On a success, the mammoth flings the creature up to 30 feet overhead and up to 30 feet away (the creature takes damage from the fall as normal, up to 15 bludgeoning damage for a 30-foot fall). If the flung creature lands on another creature, the creature it lands on takes the same amount of bludgeoning damage (check (reflex, dc:28, basic) save).",
