          "name": "Sticky",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The tar ooze is hit by a melee attack\nEffect The ooze attempts to Grapple the creature that hit it. The ooze must still spend an action to extend the duration of the Grab on subsequent rounds, as normal.",
