          "name": "Viscous Sludge",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The tar ooze can have up to eight creatures grabbed at the same time; doing so doesn't prevent it from making pseudopod Strikes. A tar ooze can climb on ceilings and other inverted surfaces, though such surfaces are difficult terrain.",
