      "traits": [
        "mechanical",
        "trap"
      ],
      "description": "A hopper full of wooden sling bullets is attached to several launching devices, which spew the bullets at high velocity through various holes in the boards covering the window. A distinctive \"click\" and whirring sound indicate the trap has been sprung.",
