          "description": "Trigger The front door is fully opened, Forced Open, or broken\nEffect A hail of iron darts launches along a 20-foot line from the desk through the doorway, dealing 4d8+10 piercing damage to each creature in the area of effect (check (reflex, dc:24, basic)).",
