          "name": "Spell Reflection",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The glass elephant is targeted by a spell\nEffect The elephant positions its reflective magical surfaces to turn the spell back on the caster. It tries to counteract the spell, making an Athletics check for its counteract check. If it successfully counteracts the spell, the effect is turned back on the caster.",
