          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements Pesgahi is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour.\nEffect Pesgahi devours a chunk of the corpse and regains 2d6 healing Hit Points.\nHe can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once.",
