          "description": "Saving Throw check (fortitude, dc:25)\nMaximum Duration 6 rounds\nStage 1 2d8 poison damage (1 round)\nStage 2 3d8 poison damage (1 round)\nStage 3 4d8 poison damage (1 round)",
