      "size": "medium",
      "traits": [
        "chaotic",
        "evil",
        "hag",
        "humanoid"
      ],
      "description": "Rust hags have a knack for technology. They make their homes in hollowed-out factories, abandoned tenements, and other sites of urban decay.\nHags are surprisingly diverse, both in abilities and in their terrain.",
      "armorClass": 26,
      "hitPoints": 135,
      "speedFeet": 25,
