          "id": "IsGLZSTgHv6OcM8A",
          "name": "Stick Support",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "If a creeping crone is deprived of her walking stick, her Speed is reduced to 5 feet (though she can use some other Speed she gains, such as from her Fly spell) until she recovers her walking stick or fashions another.",
          "traits": []
