          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The ghoul gnawer is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour\nEffect The ghoul gnawer devours a chunk of the corpse and regains 5d6 healing Hit Points. It can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once.",
