          "name": "Paralysis",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Any living, non-elf creature hit by a ghoul gnawer's attack must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:27, options:inflicts:paralyzed) save or become Paralyzed. The creature can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save.",
