          "name": "Overwhelming Ectoplasm",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "An ectoplasmic amalgam's Strikes affect incorporeal creatures with the effects of a Ghost Touch property rune. A creature damaged by an ectoplasmic amalgam's Strikes is Stunned 1 unless they succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:36) save, as the thoughts and emotions of the amalgam's constituent souls invade their mind.",
