          "id": "He2fdrt0rsXCnXBA",
          "name": "Discerning Aura",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "30 feet. All undead within the aura glow blue, shedding dim light in a 5-foot radius. Visible undead can't be Concealed while affected by this aura. Invisible undead are concealed while affected by this aura, rather than being undetected.\nEffect: Discerning Aura",
