          "id": "NIurbkvNlbq5lWX9",
          "name": "Gird in Prayer",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger An ally within the shabti votary's aura is the target of a death, mental, or possession effect\nEffect The shabti votary girds their ally in protective prayers. The triggering creature gains a +2 status bonus to saving throws against death, mental, and possession effects until the beginning of the shabti votary's next turn.\nEffect: Gird in Prayer",
