          "name": "Expand Aura",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per turn\nEffect The shabti votary focuses their will, expanding the area of their discerning aura by 20 feet for 1 minute. This expansion is cumulative with other uses of Expand Aura.",
