          "name": "Fascinating Facets",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "20 feet. The thought shards composing the intellect assemblage's body reflect countless memories, thoughts, and dreams. A creature that starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a check (will, dc:38) save or become Fascinated with the intellect assemblage for 1 round. An intellect assemblage can suppress or activate this aura as a single action with the concentrate trait.",
