      "routine": "(2 actions) On its initiative, the Fiendflame Cage uses 1 action to release a wave of hellfire, dealing 2d10+12 spirit damage|traits:unholy] to all creatures in a 15-foot burst (check (reflex, dc:47, basic)). The Fiendflame Cage uses its second action to release a wave of holy light, dealing 2d10+12 spirit damage|traits:holy] to all creatures in a 15-foot burst (check (reflex, dc:47, basic)).",
      "reset": "The trap resets after 24 hours.",
