          "name": "Snap Shot",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Requirements The Mivanian soldier holds a loaded spike launcher\nTrigger A creature within 30 feet of the soldier uses a move action, makes a ranged attack, or leaves a square during a move action it's using\nEffect The Mivanian soldier attempts a spike launcher Strike against the triggering creature. This Strike doesn't contribute to their multiple attack penalty, and their multiple attack penalty doesn't apply to this Strike.",
          "traits": []
