          "description": "Frequency three times per day\nTrigger A Strike scores a critical hit on the bhanyada behemoth\nEffect A critical hit might simply sever a component chunk that the bhanyada can lose without much harm. The bhanyada behemoth attempts a check (flat, dc:11). On a success, it doesn't take any extra damage from the critical hit (although it takes other effects normally, such as critical specialization effects).",
          "traits": []
