          "description": "10 feet. Creatures other than aberrations that enter or start their turn in the bhanyada's aura must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:29) save or become Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical failure). A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute.",
